Void
https://github.com/voidzero-dev/void

`apps/void-sandbox` builds the fixed `noite-void-sandbox` controller bundle
against the pinned `void` npm version (`void/_sandbox-container` is bundled
into `dist/worker.js` at the image build), and the Noite-owned runtime
(`apps/void-sandbox/src/controller.ts`, `apps/void-sandbox/src/admission.ts`
and the `getSandbox` validation in `apps/void-sandbox/worker.ts`) adapts
Void's `sandbox-controller-runtime.ts`, `sandbox-concurrency-counter.ts` and
service validation. The adapted files carry "adapted from" notices marking
every Noite change.

